  "bodyHash": "f6dadd65c3aa873f",
  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">這是一個用於在<strong><span style=\"color:#f00\"><a style=\"color:#f00\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic fight</strong></a></span>和<span style=\"color:#36f\"><strong><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/solo-craft-reawakening\" rel=\"nofollow\">Solo Leveling: Reawakening</a></span></strong>之間兼容性的數據包。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">SL:R + EF兼容性數據包的增強版本。在增強版本中，為獨特的匕首和某些武器添加了新動畫集。</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">數據包的標準版本是</span> <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/sl-r-epic-fight-compat-datapack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裏</a></strong></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#fff\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>模組版本鏈接 - <span style=\"color:#169179\"><a style=\"color:#169179\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/slrefextended\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">SLR Extended Mod</a></span></strong></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px\">需要安裝的附加項有：</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#e03e2d\"><a style=\"color:#e03e2d\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/weapons-of-miracles-epicfight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Miracles之劍</a></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#e03e2d\"><a style=\"color:#e03e2d\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epicfight-resurrection\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EpicFight:Resurrection</a></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">我建議使用<span style=\"color:#000\"> <span style=\"color:#5f0087\"><strong><a style=\"color:#5f0087\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/solo-leveling-arsenal\" rel=\"nofollow\">Solo Leveling Arsenal</a></strong> </span></span>來獲得武器的3D模型</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">如果您對SL:R模組有任何疑問： <strong><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><a style=\"color:#236fa1\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252f36ejJENP74\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord (SL:R官方discord)</a></span></strong></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\">如何安裝</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">saves/your_world/datapacks</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#fff\">快速修復以查看每日任務動畫：</span></strong><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">1. 按Esc - Mods</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">2. 在搜索框輸入：Epic fight</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">3. 點擊\"config\"</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">4. 然後點擊\"Graphics\"</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">5. Filter Animation: On</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#fff\">第一視角的快速修復</span></strong><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">1. 按Esc - Mods</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">2. 在搜索框輸入：Epic fight</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">3. 點擊\"config\"</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">4. 然後點擊\"Graphics\"</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">5. First person model: OFF</span><br><br><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#ba372a\">將Epic fight戰鬥重新綁定到另一個按鈕 - 比如F4。您仍然可以使用SLR技能的鍵\"R\"</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#bfedd2\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\">在詢問之前請先確認</span></strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">1. 輸入：/datapack list</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">2. 如果您看不到數據包，則檢查\"如何安裝\"</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">3. 重新加入世界並檢查</span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
